{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Pine is a single-player, 2D adventure  set in the fictional Lone Pine National Park.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Izzie, a young outdoors buff and aspiring photographer, who has travelled to Lone Pine to attempt to gather evidence of 'cryptids': mythical creatures whose very existence is disputed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a raging storm hits, and Izzie discovers that not all on the mountain is as it seems, explore, climb, solve puzzles, uncover mysteries, and create the path forward to find your way home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world folklore and mythology, solve a hybrid of  adventure game and  interactive puzzles to separate fact from fiction in this strange, forgotten place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery of Lone Pine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture evidence of cryptids in a realistic photography mini-game. Learn to master exposure and timing to get the perfect shot, and name your discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully voice-acted characters with dynamic branching dialogue. Your choices matter in this narrative adventure, with two endings based on player choices. Experience Izzie\u2019s story, and decide how she deals with the past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice-acted and lip-synced characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital hand-drawn art  (no generative AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic photography mini-game that gradually teaches you real-life camera settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid of  adventure game and  interactive puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings based on player choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575850?t=1773403898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/66384a5c16d81fe50277442a66358cd98ebb8060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773403898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/b101b2e7a46f9843a20ec6791ecce21546ff59ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773403898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/b101b2e7a46f9843a20ec6791ecce21546ff59ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773403898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Pine is a single-player, 2D adventure  set in the fictional Lone Pine National Park.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Izzie, a young outdoors buff and aspiring photographer, who has travelled to Lone Pine to attempt to gather evidence of 'cryptids': mythical creatures whose very existence is disputed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a raging storm hits, and Izzie discovers that not all on the mountain is as it seems, explore, climb, solve puzzles, uncover mysteries, and create the path forward to find your way home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world folklore and mythology, solve a hybrid of  adventure game and  interactive puzzles to separate fact from fiction in this strange, forgotten place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery of Lone Pine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture evidence of cryptids in a realistic photography mini-game. Learn to master exposure and timing to get the perfect shot, and name your discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully voice-acted characters with dynamic branching dialogue. Your choices matter in this narrative adventure, with two endings based on player choices. Experience Izzie\u2019s story, and decide how she deals with the past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.poster.avif?t=1773403898\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.webm?t=1773403898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice-acted and lip-synced characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital hand-drawn art  (no generative AI)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic photography mini-game that gradually teaches you real-life camera settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hybrid of  adventure game and  interactive puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings based on player choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bang Bang Bang Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/cc6db35f80b76ed56fd0c7a275021510d2dea834/header.jpg?t=1773403898","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3575850/552567741/25e1babe3406c03023b4b2d77cc65a8932fd2098/1759667097/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759667651","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3575850/552567741/25e1babe3406c03023b4b2d77cc65a8932fd2098/1759667097/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759667651","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3575850/552567741/25e1babe3406c03023b4b2d77cc65a8932fd2098/1759667097/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759667651","id":257134454,"name":"Lone Pine Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134454/46d85c51871efb1b0fc49946caa59e2a0ac5505a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759667651"}],"name":"Lone Pine","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</stro